  "id": "st-louis",
  "intro": "St Louis sits where the Missouri joins the Mississippi, and the rivers are the reason to listen. This is the head of the barge navigation that runs to the Gulf, the locks and the harbour service are worked constantly on VHF, and the two rivers meeting produce genuinely tricky boat handling that you can follow channel by channel. Inland, Scott Air Force Base is the headquarters of US air mobility, so the military UHF band carries traffic with a reach far beyond Illinois. Tornado season makes the weather transmitters matter.",
  "introz": "圣路易斯位于密苏里河汇入密西西比河之处，而河流正是值得收听的原因。这里是通往墨西哥湾的驳船航道起点，船闸和港务调度在 VHF 上不停通话，两河交汇处的操船难度很高，可以一个频道一个频道地跟下来。内陆一侧，斯科特空军基地是美国空运司令部所在地，因此军航 UHF 频段承载的通信影响范围远超伊利诺伊州。龙卷风季节让气象发射台变得格外重要。",
